* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
* Mult   Multi-file: a value for each subfile, "Mult " and the type of the first, then the type of each other subfile
* Err    Error
* Dir    Directory file
* DH     Dynamic hashed file
*           I  Has indices
*           S  Stats enabled
*           T  Has trigger
*
